## Status: CANONICAL META / WAIT FOR EVIDENCE

This is the single owner for the final rewrite of trycua/cua#3963. Older meta tickets #51/#52/#56/#61 were closed into this issue.

Do **not** repeatedly rewrite the RFC while decisive experiments are still returning. Update the disposition table incrementally; produce the final prose after the evidence queue reaches a stable state.

## Already decided

- no universal shadow-state service;
- no second verifier/PostconditionService;
- no generic Driver DecisionService/RouterService;
- no generic lifecycle service;
- no competing batch API;
- no fixed GuardedRun length of 4;
- #3946 owns truthful internal post-action polling state;
- #4009 owns public `post_dispatch_observation`;
- #3873/SnapshotStore owns native element freshness;
- #3961 remains provider-only; maintainer requested a current-main re-cut rather than wholesale rebase. Remaining salvage is #77 OpenJev backend → #78 browser provider parity/backend receipts;
- #4164 is **merged** with native macOS producer evidence;
- #4165 is superseded by #4196;
- #4196 is the canonical visual-routing owner and downstream #2 is now **fully qualified/closed** using merged #4266/#4190/#4326 evidence;
- #4052 is **merged** and owns browser phase timing; #75 owns the behavior-neutral native timing comparison follow-up.

## Still evidence-gated

- #4316 exact-head guarded completion execution / structural 2→1 provider-decision proof;
- #4317 / #36 real two-session authority isolation;
- #10 whole-task benchmark on the surviving exact heads;
